  <section class="wrap fiche-body">
    <div>
      <h2>The vibe</h2>
      <p>Au Chien Chic is located on rue Pascal, in the Mourillon district of Toulon. The salon offers baths, de-shedding, clipping and scissor cuts, plus a range of accessories: ready-to-wear clothing for dogs, leashes, collars, harnesses, cushions, carrier crates, shampoos and perfumes.</p>

      <h2>What to know before you go</h2>
      <p>A free nail trim comes with every grooming session, a nice touch that saves a separate trip to the vet just for that. One thing to watch: an independent directory links a different phone number and hours to the same address — possibly another business in the same building, possibly a directory error. The number 04 83 42 67 44 remains the most widely confirmed (PagesJaunes, chien.com); if in doubt, check by calling.</p>
      <div class="callout">Coco's tip: use the visit to the salon to pick up a new leash or harness if needed — everything is sold on site.</div>

      <h2>Nearby</h2>
      <p>The Mourillon district and its beach are right next door, a good option for a walk before or after grooming.</p>
